<h1 style="margin:0 0 18px;font-size:25px;line-height:1.3;color:#0f172a;">Choose a new password</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:16px;">A password reset was requested for your ClientScope account. Completing the reset signs out all existing sessions; you will need to sign in again.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;"><a href="https://clientscope.example/reset-password?token=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#4338ca;border:1px solid #4338ca;border-radius:6px;padding:13px 20px;color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;">Reset password</a></p>
<p style="font-size:13px;color:#475569;margin:0 0 6px;">If the button is unavailable, open this link:</p>
<p style="font-size:13px;margin:0 0 24px;word-break:break-all;"><a href="https://clientscope.example/reset-password?token=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa" style="color:#3730a3;text-decoration:underline;">https://clientscope.example/reset-password?token=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa</a></p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#475569;">This link expires one hour after it was issued. A replacement link invalidates the previous link. If you did not request a reset, ignore this email; your password will stay unchanged.</p>
<hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin:28px 0 18px;">
<p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#475569;">ClientScope — Clear work. Clear decisions.<br>This is a transactional account or project notification.</p>
</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "subject": "Reset your ClientScope password",
  "text": "ClientScope

Choose a new password

A password reset was requested for your ClientScope account. Completing the reset signs out all existing sessions; you will need to sign in again.

Reset password:
https://clientscope.example/reset-password?token=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa

This link expires one hour after it was issued. A replacement link invalidates the previous link. If you did not request a reset, ignore this email; your password will stay unchanged.

ClientScope — Clear work. Clear decisions.
This is a transactional account or project notification.",
  "to": "recipient@example.com",
}
`;

